# VoxelCraft Web

A browser-based, multiplayer voxel sandbox inspired by Bloxd.io and Minecraft.

## Features
- Browser-based play from PC or mobile
- Multiplayer world sync using Socket.IO
- Block placement and removal
- Inventory + hotbar
- Crafting recipes
- Day/night world mood
- Simple voxel terrain generation

## Run locally

```bash
npm install
npm start
```

Then open:
- http://localhost:3000

## Controls
- WASD: move
- Mouse click: place block
- Right click: remove block
- Number keys 1-6: hotbar selection
- T: open chat
- G: craft helper button

## Notes
This is an original browser prototype for a web game, not a copy of Minecraft's assets or code.
